WEBVTT

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:04.889
First, let's set up the booster using its built-in indoor antenna.

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:11.126
Connect the outdoor antenna's cable, then route it indoors to the booster.

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:18.886
With power disconnected, mount the black booster and connect that cable to its outdoor port.

00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:24.905
Select Internal mode.

00:00:24.905 --> 00:00:27.800
The booster itself provides the indoor antenna.

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:35.289
For the second option, add the white indoor panel antenna where you want coverage.

00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:42.547
With power disconnected, run the antenna's cable back to the booster.

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:46.068
Connect it to the indoor port.

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:53.797
Select External to use the panel alone, or Dual to use both indoor antennas.

00:00:53.797 --> 00:00:57.771
Once everything is connected, plug in the supplied power adapter.
